=== Ushma — Phase Change Material Storage ===

--- Water as Phase Change Material ---
  100 kg water:
  Latent heat of fusion:       33400 kJ
  Latent heat of vaporization: 226000 kJ
  Sensible heat (10 K rise):   4186 kJ
  Fusion stores 8× more than 10 K sensible

--- Ice to Steam (1 kg, -20°C to 120°C) ---
  Total energy: 2944 kJ

--- Phase Diagram ---
  Ice at -73°C: T=200 K, P=101325 Pa → Solid
  Liquid at 27°C: T=300 K, P=101325 Pa → Liquid
  Steam at 127°C: T=400 K, P=101325 Pa → Gas
  Supercritical: T=700 K, P=25000000 Pa → SupercriticalFluid

--- Boiling Point vs Pressure ---
  P=101 kPa → T_boil=100.0 °C
  P=80 kPa → T_boil=93.4 °C
  P=60 kPa → T_boil=85.7 °C
  P=40 kPa → T_boil=75.3 °C

--- Substance Comparison ---
Substance           T_boil(K)  T_crit(K) L_vap(kJ/kg)
----------------------------------------------------
Water                   373.1      647.1       2260
Nitrogen                 77.4      126.2        199
Oxygen                   90.2      154.6        213
Carbon dioxide          194.7      304.1        234
Ammonia                 239.8      405.6       1370
Methane                 111.7      190.6        510
Ethanol                 351.4      513.9        841
Mercury                 629.9     1750.0        295

